# Mutation plan for the 2026-09-13 licensed halves of the acknowledgement pair (D-422), createTermsOfService
# (D-382) and the team/channel archive cleanup (D-371).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/lic-acks-tos-teams.plan
#
# The decisions a reader gets wrong: the deadline's direction, which archived-channel check fires on
# which half, that a delete zeroes rather than removes, that a re-acknowledgement moves the timestamp,
# that both writes stamp the post, which rung the gate tests, the order of the id and permission
# checks, the feature flag's default on an unlicensed server, the ABAC gate's direction, and whether
# the two archives clean up their policy row at all. The last two lines are the controls and must SURVIVE.
#
# `gate-user-id-before-post-id` is expected to SURVIVE: the two `invalid_url_param` refusals share an id
# and differ only in the translated `message`, which the suite tolerates until [D-092] lands. It is kept
# so the day messages are compared it starts biting.
